BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (hours [AKtcv_vFlSY @ 00:01:13]. Easytorial tells operators not to just click through Cloudflare's automated record) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (import: review every record, especially the root record pointing at the server IP and the www CNAME, and flip MX) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (and verification records to the grey-cloud DNS-only setting, otherwise those services will not work correctly) Tj ET
