BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (frustrates beginners [oi-pZAGrrhQ @ 00:02:25]. Craylor adds two beginner traps: Cloudflare is not web hosting, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (you still need a server for it to point at, and the free plan box sits underneath the paid columns, which makes new users) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (message him thinking Cloudflare expects $20 a month; he also admits first-timers may make mistakes and need) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (troubleshooting before everything works [IXpvUD5SDzA @ 00:01:25].) Tj ET
